t":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":"images/artists/ta-ku/tracks/i-miss-you.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PXQa1HxDvAg","slug":"136","tags":[1,2,15],"links":{"mixcloud":"https://www.mixcloud.com/soulection/show-136-w-astronautica/"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #136 w/ Astronautica","artwork":"/images/episodes/136.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10761,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-07-13T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"YkwQZ4RJ7Ds","position":37,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ta-Ku - Donut Interlude","track":{"id":"ETtcgcIvj9A","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/donut-interlude/","slug":"donut-interlude","title":"Donut Interlude","artist":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":"images/artists/ta-ku/tracks/donut-interlude.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"vPfL7UzxY4Y","slug":"139","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-139-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #139 w/ DJ Harrison","artwork":"/images/episodes/139.jpg","content":"DJ Harrison thows down a crazy live improvised session with the SP-404 and MPC1000\n\n<!--more-->\n\noe Kay started off with some nice deep/melodic tracks from Mr. Carmack, Christoph El Truento, Dirg Gerner, Iamnobodi, Sango, Last Night In Paris, Geode and many more! Joe took it back to the essence with Ginuwine/Timbaland/Dilla classics! DJ Harrison on the other hand who reminds us of Madlib (no really he does)all the way from Virginia threw down a crazy live session with the SP-404 & MPC 1000. Lots of soulful chops and intricate drum patterns! This is another amazing session from start to finish! Spread this if you feel it.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10810,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-03T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"zVnIU7bDdcs","position":37,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ta-Ku - Closest Drake Fans","track":{"id":"3mbb8digmFg","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/closest-drake-fans/","slug":"closest-drake-fans","title":"Closest Drake Fans","artist":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":"images/artists/ta-ku/tracks/closest-drake-fans.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"2dVRfkYMblA","slug":"142","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-142-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #142 w/ Kloud","artwork":"/images/episodes/142.jpg","content":"Co-founder of The Melt \"Kloud\" spins a diverse set of house, R&B, soul, 2-step and bass.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10816,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-24T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"uYskmmJX4Yk","position":15,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ta-ku - We Were In Love","track":{"id":"WIInbQiFlF8","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/we-were-in-love/","slug":"we-were-in-love","title":"We Were In Love","artist":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":"images/artists/ta-ku/tracks/we-were-in-love.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"A-2xaCFrXnk","slug":"150","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-150-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #150 w/ SOSUPERSAM","artwork":"/images/episodes/150.jpg","content":"Talented & vibrant woman SOSUPERSAM finally came through the studio. \n\n<!--more-->\nIt's been a long time coming and we're happy that you finally get a feel for who she is musically and as a person. Wasn't quite sure what she was gonna play for us, but she showed a great diversity and really brought us back to a place that was very much needed towards the end of her set. She's even cooler as a person. Being humble and driven will always get you far. Joe Kay really brought out a diverse selection of music. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-02T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"SOSUPERSAM's Set","position":1}},{"id":"_6qpdtmMB0c","position":15,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ta-KU - go","track":{"id":"nipkVa-u-2M","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/go/","slug":"go","title":"go","artist":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"fuAWzdYupSQ","slug":"159","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-159-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #159 w/ Daddy Kev","artwork":"/images/episodes/159.jpg","content":"\nKev dropps a 40 minute set that makes you feel like you're in the \"2001&#58; A Space Odyssey\" space hub.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThis week's edition of Soulection Radio was really essential. We had a pioneer and important individual who is responsible for many great things going on in our music culture today. \nHe goes by Daddy Kev which most of you may already be familiar with. He founded the legendary weekly event Low End Theory and co-founded Alpha Pup Records/Distribution. \n\nKev made sure to sprinkle all the classics as well as some forthcoming unreleased material from who knows who. \n\nThings got really interesting when Kev and Joe jumped in to the interview portion during the 2nd hour to discuss everything from experiences at Low End Theory, \nmastering (sound engineering education), the current state of today's music culture, favorite artists to work with, and even a Low End Theory festival that is coming this year. \nDefinitely an educational experience! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Daddy Kev's Set","position":1}},{"id":"s1ASqWczNjo","position":17,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ta-Ku - Donut Interlude","track":{"id":"ETtcgcIvj9A","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/donut-interlude/","slug":"donut-interlude","title":"Donut Interlude","artist":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":"images/artists/ta-ku/tracks/donut-interlude.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AfbBMadJe6c","slug":"162","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-162"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #162","artwork":"/images/episodes/162.jpg","content":"Joe reaches out to the listeners for the People Choice\n\n<!--more-->\n\nComing off Grammy week connections and our 3 Year Anniversary we returned for yet another solid show. Our special guests who were scheduled for this show couldn't make it but Joe Kay brought out a variety of new and classic gems from the Soulection crates. This show was really engaging because Joe reached out to all the listeners and asked the audience what they wanted to hear via social media. It was amazing to see how many people were listening and how many people requested for a certain track. For the last hour and 1/2 you the people we're DJ'ing/selecting music! How amazing right? Try to tune in live next time. The live feelings is always better. We'll catch you next week at the same time. Spread this if you feel it because it really is strictly about the music. Stay tuned for our 3 Year Anniversary Party announcement on Monday (1/27/14).\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"VAyJDRciQCA","position":2,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ta-ku - ONEFORTREY","track":{"id":"bMN9PmxOy3o","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/onefortrey/","slug":"onefortrey","title":"ONEFORTREY","artist":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":"images/artists/ta-ku/tracks/onefortrey.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"iiHdl1Frjo4","slug":"166","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-166-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #166 w/ Esta & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/episodes/166.jpg","content":"ESTA., The Whooligan and Joe Kay five you a special sonic experiance.\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10873,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-22T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"The Whooligan's Set","position":3}},{"id":"1utQkoXR42g","position":60,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ta-ku - Hey Justin Pt.II","track":{"id":"xWcnle71njU","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/hey-justin-pt-ii/","slug":"hey-justin-pt-ii","title":"Hey Justin Pt Ii","artist":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":"images/artists/ta-ku/tracks/hey-justin-pt-ii.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Bd4yLv8Leyg","slug":"171","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-171"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #171","artwork":"/images/episodes/171.jpg","content":"Joe Kay returned with an immense amount and plenty of new ideas/inspiration after Coachella Weekend 1. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere are so many new gems in here. We also recently discovered this new platform/label out of Sydney called: [@flowfi](https://soundcloud.com/flowfi) (Accidentally spelled them out wrong on the show as F-L-O), but these guys are coming with HEAT. Make sure you pay attention to them. If you feel this whole session please share. Lets keep educating people with real music. Catch you next week at the same time.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10801,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-19T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"E8T81gNEVkw","position":15,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ta-ku - Hustle","track":{"id":"0CKhX9Eh_8c","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/hustle/","slug":"hustle","title":"Hustle","artist":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":"images/artists/ta-ku/tracks/hustle.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"5Xbl7MTHePo","slug":"172","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-172-w-rhettmatic-beat-junkies"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #172 w/ Rhettmatic (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/172.jpg","content":"Rhettmatic of the legendary beat Junkies Crew graces us with a 50 minute set + an in depth interview. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nRhett is definitely one of the most humble guests we've had on here and is more connected than anyone really knows. Do yourself a favor and get mentally prepared to learn a lot. It's much more than just music. Shouts to Rhettmatic, Mr. Choc, J. Rocc, and the rest of the Beat Junkies crew. Also, big big up to Free The Robots for coming through the studio and vibing with us. Much love to you & the whole Crosby crew. Stay tuned for much more to come. Enjoy.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10880,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Rhettmatic's Set","position":1}},{"id":"OA2UDyKUPB4","position":58,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ta-ku - Untitled","track":{"id":"bCPZkl-wyAo","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/untitled/","slug":"untitled","title":"Untitled","artist":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":"images/artists/ta-ku/tracks/untitled.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"kcFYGuzURsQ","slug":"189","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-189"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #189","artwork":"/images/episodes/189.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10725,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-10-18T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"S_7CD8Tk4-c","position":7,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ta-Ku - Uh","track":{"id":"fx9jDNGyKXY","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/uh/","slug":"uh","title":"Uh","artist":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":"images/artists/ta-ku/tracks/uh.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"w4gYRLgk3zs","slug":"193","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-193-w-sosupersam-hannah-faith-yukibeb-kronika-eden-hagos"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #193 w/ SoSuperSam, Hannah Faith, Sasha Marie, Yukibeb, Kronika, & Eden","artwork":"/images/episodes/193.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10871,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Hannah Faith's Set","position":2}},{"id":"RQuF4ig9gB0","position":13,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"ta-ku - ciarabubble","track":{"id":"6zOg91n9SMQ","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/ciarabubble/","slug":"ciarabubble","title":"ciarabubble","artist":{"slug":"ta-ku","title":"Ta-Ku"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"w4gYRLgk3zs","slug":"193","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-193-w-sosupersam-hannah-faith-yukibeb-kronika-eden-hagos"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #193 w/ SoSuperSam, Hannah Faith, Sasha Marie, Yukibeb, Kronika, & Eden","artwork":"/images/episodes/193.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10871,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Yuki's Set","position":3}},{"id":"TOLDBA60cnM","position":19,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Ta-Ku - Donut Interlude","track":{"id":"ETtcgcIvj9A","path":"/artists/ta-ku/tracks/donut-interlude/","slug":"donut-interlude","